                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7ac7ba9c-e051-3323-afe2-13761d3d506a",
                        "entry_id": "a5ae46ed-d138-3eaf-a47b-f240786d53f4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "National, avec l’emphase sur le « pays entier »."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "320d0d82-3bd9-4370-be11-75e9cb7933c9",
                                "sense_id": "7ac7ba9c-e051-3323-afe2-13761d3d506a",
                                "text": "While the nationwide strategy for brittle books is now well articulated and broadly accepted, there is not yet such consensus regarding coordinated strategies for archival materials."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "005f028d-d20a-4f9f-ad7d-17f79e7e3205",
                                "sense_id": "7ac7ba9c-e051-3323-afe2-13761d3d506a",
                                "text": "In a nationwide survey conducted in 2006, the Justice Research and Statistics Association (JRSA) found that there are currently in place or under development 266 separate systems that share information about crime."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0597e11d-226a-4237-9495-f0d154a63bac",
                                "sense_id": "7ac7ba9c-e051-3323-afe2-13761d3d506a",
                                "text": "Any effective response to the poppy boom must feature an integrated and nationwide approach in order to avoid merely displacing production from one region to another."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "442ee645-42d0-37f3-a8c1-e2ee2b0b1e94",
                "word": "nationwide",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9a93221c-d03c-33cf-a72a-0b604ee4b2c8",
                        "entry_id": "442ee645-42d0-37f3-a8c1-e2ee2b0b1e94",
                        "glosses": [
                            "À l’échelle du pays, réparti(e)s dans tout le pays."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e220385-b8fc-4a90-a199-acda3801db68",
                                "sense_id": "9a93221c-d03c-33cf-a72a-0b604ee4b2c8",
                                "text": "… all citizens would presumably welcome a network of facilities operating nationwide, so long as none were close at hand."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1cd10f5-d3eb-4521-b223-dc85453805c1",
                                "sense_id": "9a93221c-d03c-33cf-a72a-0b604ee4b2c8",
                                "text": "In fact, a recent study estimated that there currently are approximately 300 such groups nationwide that seek to counter the far right."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "55fa50b7-0f56-4deb-9bb4-399fcf9097fd",
                                "sense_id": "9a93221c-d03c-33cf-a72a-0b604ee4b2c8",
                                "text": "Because of the social importance of post offices nationwide it is imperative that government and/or local authorities find ways of subsidising local post offices."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
